{"4409390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pogo Froggo", "steam_appid": 4409390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4796740], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two frogs, one bar, zero coordination. Bounce up the mountain before your tank breaks... and before you blame each other.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br>Land at the wrong angle and your water tank cracks. Crack it again, and it's over. Fall in the wrong place, and it's over. Lose sync with your partner for one second and watch both of you tumble back to the last checkpoint... again.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409390/extras/69b4fa963cf9504596e198520c453f60.poster.avif?t=1781534599\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409390/extras/69b4fa963cf9504596e198520c453f60.webm?t=1781534599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409390/extras/69b4fa963cf9504596e198520c453f60.mp4?t=1781534599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pogo Froggo is a cooperative precision platformer built around one simple idea: bouncing is hard.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409390/extras/4d09950757859d73c2ea326e498f74e7.poster.avif?t=1781534599\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409390/extras/4d09950757859d73c2ea326e498f74e7.webm?t=1781534599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409390/extras/4d09950757859d73c2ea326e498f74e7.mp4?t=1781534599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br> <br><strong>Bouncing while connected to another person is hard. Bouncing w</strong>ith a huge water tank in your head is something else...<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409390/extras/5be6c6598416ec3390fa3a13e03125d0.poster.avif?t=1781534599\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409390/extras/5be6c6598416ec3390fa3a13e03125d0.webm?t=1781534599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4409390/extras/5be6c6598416ec3390fa3a13e03125d0.mp4?t=1781534599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You'll argue about whose fault it was. You'll try again. You'll finally nail that jump you've been failing for 20 minutes and scream. Then immediately fall on the next one.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or co-op — control both frogs alone, or play with a friend locally or online</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pogo physics — every jump, angle, and momentum matters. No shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasingly brutal levels — each with its own obstacles and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic obstacles — giant fish, rotating platforms, hidden traps, falling platforms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses — because you haven't suffered enough yet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints — you'll need them more than you think</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two frogs, one bar, zero coordination. Bounce up the mountain before your tank breaks... and before you blame each other.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <br>Land at the wrong angle and your water tank cracks. Crack it again, and it's over. Fall in the wrong place, and it's over. Lose sync with your partner